@format 1
@id keyframes.suspend
@title Suspend keyframe scanning
@area Keyframes
@entry input
@summary Cancel and dispose the active keyframe scan request without discarding accumulated keyframes.
@flow TB
@related keyframes.scan

@alias key = Cadroue.Infrastructure.LKeyframeOrchestrator

[input] Scanning suspension requested <input>
- Receive media replacement, timeline clearing, or disposal request @ key.LKeyframeSuspend(...)
> cancel

[cancel] Cancel active work <process>
- Detach, cancel, and dispose the current scan token source @ key.LKeyframeSuspend(...)
> result

[result] Scanning suspended <output>
= Active scan work stops; already accumulated keyframes remain available until source state changes.
